  "details": "OnParticleCollision event node currently doesn't output where the particle collided at. Would be good to have the particle collision event output a ParticleCollisionEvent similiar to how OnCollisionEnter outputs a Collision. May also work to simply have access to the particle systems collision list as exampled here: https://docs.unity3d.com/ScriptReference/MonoBehaviour.OnParticleCollision.html\nUses for this would be numerous, such as creating decals on collided objects or triggering  other events based upon particle collision location.",
